{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-jumeirah-residences-emiratestowers","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"jumeirah-residences-emirates-towers-meraas","about":"Rising alongside Dubai’s iconic skyline, Jumeirah Residences Emirates Towers by Meraas introduces a new benchmark in elevated city living. From stylish 1-bedroom apartments to expansive 4-bedroom double-height residences with private pools and panoramic terraces, each residence is meticulously crafted to reflect the finest in contemporary design and architectural excellence. High ceilings, floor-to-ceiling windows, and open-plan living spaces create a seamless connection between indoor luxury and breathtaking city views.Set within one of the most prestigious addresses in Dubai, the development is nestled beside the Museum of the Future and the Jumeirah Emirates Towers Hotel. Jumeirah Residences at Emirates Towers are complemented by thoughtfully designed amenities — including exclusive sky terraces, infinity pools, private cinemas, executive gyms, and spa facilities. Residents are also treated to Jumeirah Signature Services, ensuring a lifestyle defined by comfort, convenience, and world-class hospitality. With seamless connectivity to Sheikh Zayed Road and Al Khail Road, and destinations like City Walk and Downtown Dubai just minutes away, this address offers both prestige and accessibility in equal measure.","price":3510000,"title":"Jumeirah Residences Emirates Towers","bitrix":{"id":1217,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Emirates Towers","tower_name":"Jumeirah Emirates Tower","campaign_name":"Jumeirah Residences","property_type":"Apartments","developer_name":"Meraas","project_location":"Sheikh Zayed Road"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Jumeirah_Residences_Emirates_Towers_by_Meraas_Jumeirah_Residences_Emirates_Towers_by_Meraas_db42203598.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpw